      "date": "2026-05-23T20:00:08.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹36.56 (down from ₹43.21 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹49.0b (up 21% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹14.4b (down 16% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 29% (down from 42% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.4%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 15%. Revenue is expected to decline by 1.1% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Media industry in India are expected to grow by 8.4%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 6% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
